---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
---

<ProjectLayout
  title="Local-First AI Research & Bioinformatics Hub"
  description="Private MCP retrieval server on Proxmox CT 107 unifying sub-10ms Zoekt code search, DevDocs and Kiwix offline archives, DuckDB BM25 arXiv search, and NCBI BLAST+ genomics."
  canonicalPath="/projects/research-hub"
  category="Retrieval Systems & Bioinformatics"
  summary="Private Model Context Protocol (FastMCP) server on Proxmox CT 107 giving coding and scientific agents sub-10ms local access to source repositories, offline documentation, arXiv literature, and viral sequence indexes."
  stack={['FastMCP', 'Zoekt', 'DuckDB BM25', 'virology.duckdb · BLAST+', 'DevDocs · Kiwix']}
  liveUrl="#telemetry"
  liveLabel="Index Telemetry ↓"
  secondaryUrl="/#contact"
  secondaryLabel="Discuss Private MCP / RAG"
>
  <!-- Live Corpus & Engine Telemetry Strip -->
  <section id="telemetry" class="studio-panel telemetry-panel" aria-labelledby="telemetry-heading">
    <div class="panel-top">
      <div>
        <span class="spec-label">CT 107 Corpus &amp; Index State</span>
        <h2 id="telemetry-heading" class="panel-title">Research Hub Telemetry</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="telemetry-indicator mono" id="research-live-pill" title="Querying /api/research/status">
        <span class="status-dot" id="research-pill-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span id="research-pill-label">Checking CT 107...</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="corpus-strip" role="region" aria-label="Indexed corpus metrics">
      <div class="corpus-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">Zoekt Code Index</span>
        <strong class="corpus-val mono" id="kpi-zoekt">65 Shards</strong>
        <span class="corpus-sub mono" id="kpi-repos">59 local &amp; upstream repos (&lt;10ms)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="corpus-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">arXiv Literature</span>
        <strong class="corpus-val mono" id="kpi-arxiv">71,500+</strong>
        <span class="corpus-sub mono">DuckDB inverted BM25 (~3ms)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="corpus-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">Viral Genomics</span>
        <strong class="corpus-val mono" id="kpi-viral">19,625</strong>
        <span class="corpus-sub mono">virology.duckdb + BLAST+</span>
      </div>
      <div class="corpus-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">Offline Archives</span>
        <strong class="corpus-val mono" id="kpi-zim">4 ZIM + Docs</strong>
        <span class="corpus-sub mono">DevDocs + 2.4 GB Kiwix dumps</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="telemetry-meta-grid">
      <div class="meta-block">
        <span class="spec-label">Mounted Offline Knowledge Archives</span>
        <div class="archive-list mono" id="zim-badge-container">
          <span class="archive-chip">DevDocs Offline API Reference</span>
          <span class="archive-chip">Bioinformatics StackExchange</span>
          <span class="archive-chip">Biology StackExchange</span>
          <span class="archive-chip">Chemistry StackExchange</span>
          <span class="archive-chip">CrossValidated Stats StackExchange</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="meta-block">
        <span class="spec-label">Ingestion Daemons</span>
        <div class="daemon-list mono">
          <div class="daemon-row">
            <span>zoekt_sync</span>
            <span class="daemon-state" id="status-zoekt">idle / synced</span>
          </div>
          <div class="daemon-row">
            <span>arxiv_ingest</span>
            <span class="daemon-state" id="status-arxiv">indexed</span>
          </div>
          <div class="daemon-row">
            <span>blast_db</span>
            <span class="daemon-state" id="status-blast">ready</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Concise Architectural Breakdown -->
  <section aria-labelledby="arch-heading" class="section-stack">
    <div class="prose-block">
      <span class="spec-label">Architecture</span>
      <h2 id="arch-heading">Four Local Retrieval Kernels Behind FastMCP</h2>
      <p>
        Public search APIs add latency, rate limits, and network exposure when autonomous agents iterate across dozens of code and literature queries. Hosted inside Proxmox CT 107, this service exposes local indexing kernels over a single FastMCP JSON-RPC/SSE endpoint with zero per-query cost.
      </p>
      <p>
        Agents can reformulate BM25 paper queries, jump directly to upstream function definitions via trigram search, inspect offline API docs, and run deterministic nucleotide or protein alignments without cloning repositories or sending sequence fragments over the public internet.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="spec-grid">
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">01 / Code Search</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">Zoekt Trigrams (&lt;10ms)</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">65 pre-indexed shards spanning local workspaces and 59 upstream ML/scientific repos (PyTorch, Transformers, Biopython, RDKit) for exact regex and symbol lookup.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">02 / Offline Docs</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">DevDocs &amp; Kiwix ZIM</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">Local DevDocs language/framework references paired with 2.4 GB of offline StackExchange scientific ZIM archives for instant offline lookup.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">03 / Literature</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title">DuckDB BM25 arXiv</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">71,500+ CS, AI, and q-bio preprints stored in columnar DuckDB tables with inverted BM25 scoring across titles and abstracts in ~2.8 ms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="spec-cell">
        <span class="spec-label">04 / Bioinformatics</span>
        <h3 class="spec-title"><code>virology.duckdb</code> + BLAST+</h3>
        <p class="spec-text">Relational viral taxonomy and metadata joined with NCBI BLAST+ binary databases across 19,625 RefSeq and GenBank viral genomes (40–120 ms).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MCP Tool Call Trace -->
  <section class="studio-panel" aria-labelledby="trace-heading">
    <div class="panel-top">
      <div>
        <span class="spec-label">Protocol Interface</span>
        <h2 id="trace-heading" class="panel-title">Sample FastMCP Session Trace</h2>
      </div>
      <span class="mono meta-note">JSON-RPC over SSE / stdio</span>
    </div>

    <pre class="trace-box mono"><code>[1/3] search_arxiv(query="discrete attention viral genome sequence", top_k=3)
  -&gt; DuckDB BM25 matched 14 preprints in 3.1 ms

[2/3] search_code(query="def flash_attn_func", file_filter="*.py")
  -&gt; Zoekt scanned 65 shards (59 repos) in 6.8 ms · 4 symbol hits

[3/3] run_local_blast(seq="ATGGTGCACCTGACTCCTGAGGAG...", db="viral_refseq")
  -&gt; BLAST+ + virology.duckdb aligned 19,625 records in 42.4 ms (E=2e-94)</code></pre>
  </section>
</ProjectLayout>

<script is:inline>
  (function initResearchTelemetry() {
    var pillDot = document.getElementById('research-pill-dot');
    var pillLabel = document.getElementById('research-pill-label');
    var kpiArxiv = document.getElementById('kpi-arxiv');
    var kpiViral = document.getElementById('kpi-viral');
    var kpiZoekt = document.getElementById('kpi-zoekt');
    var kpiRepos = document.getElementById('kpi-repos');
    var kpiZim = document.getElementById('kpi-zim');
    var zimContainer = document.getElementById('zim-badge-container');
    var statusZoekt = document.getElementById('status-zoekt');
    var statusArxiv = document.getElementById('status-arxiv');
    var statusBlast = document.getElementById('status-blast');

    var apiBase = window.__API_BASE__ || 'https://api.eliburgessconsulting.com';

    function prettyZimName(raw) {
      var base = String(raw)
        .replace(/\.zim$/i, '')
        .replace(/_[a-z]{2}_all(_\d{4}-\d{2})?$/i, '');
      var m = base.match(/^([a-z0-9-]+)\.stackexchange\.com$/i);
      if (m) {
        var site =
          m[1] === 'stats'
            ? 'CrossValidated Stats'
            : m[1].charAt(0).toUpperCase() + m[1].slice(1);
        return site + ' StackExchange';
      }
      return base.replace(/[_-]+/g, ' ');
    }

    var controller = typeof AbortController !== 'undefined' ? new AbortController() : null;
    var timeoutId = controller
      ? setTimeout(function () {
          controller.abort();
        }, 3500)
      : null;

    fetch(apiBase + '/api/research/status', {
      method: 'GET',
      signal: controller ? controller.signal : undefined,
      headers: { Accept: 'application/json' },
    })
      .then(function (res) {
        if (timeoutId) clearTimeout(timeoutId);
        if (!res.ok) throw new Error('HTTP ' + res.status);
        return res.json();
      })
      .then(function (data) {
        if (!data) return;

        var online = Boolean(data.online && (data.status === 'ok' || data.status === 'healthy'));
        if (pillDot) pillDot.className = online ? 'status-dot is-online' : 'status-dot';
        if (pillLabel) pillLabel.textContent = online ? 'CT 107 Online' : 'Baseline Snapshot';

        if (kpiArxiv && data.arxiv_papers) {
          kpiArxiv.textContent = Number(data.arxiv_papers).toLocaleString() + '+';
        }
        if (kpiViral && data.viral_records) {
          kpiViral.textContent = Number(data.viral_records).toLocaleString();
        }
        if (kpiZoekt && data.zoekt_shards) {
          kpiZoekt.textContent = data.zoekt_shards + ' Shards';
        }
        if (kpiRepos && data.repositories_indexed) {
          kpiRepos.textContent = data.repositories_indexed + ' local & upstream repos (<10ms)';
        }
        if (kpiZim && data.zim_count) {
          kpiZim.textContent = data.zim_count + ' ZIM + Docs';
        }

        if (zimContainer && Array.isArray(data.zim_archives) && data.zim_archives.length > 0) {
          zimContainer.innerHTML = '';
          var devdocsChip = document.createElement('span');
          devdocsChip.className = 'archive-chip';
          devdocsChip.textContent = 'DevDocs Offline API Reference';
          zimContainer.appendChild(devdocsChip);

          data.zim_archives.forEach(function (name) {
            var chip = document.createElement('span');
            chip.className = 'archive-chip';
            chip.title = String(name);
            chip.textContent = prettyZimName(name);
            zimContainer.appendChild(chip);
          });
        }

        if (data.jobs_status && typeof data.jobs_status === 'object') {
          if (statusZoekt && data.jobs_status.zoekt_sync) {
            statusZoekt.textContent = data.jobs_status.zoekt_sync;
          }
          if (statusArxiv && data.jobs_status.arxiv_ingest) {
            statusArxiv.textContent = data.jobs_status.arxiv_ingest;
          }
          if (statusBlast && data.jobs_status.blast_db) {
            statusBlast.textContent = data.jobs_status.blast_db;
          }
        }
      })
      .catch(function () {
        if (timeoutId) clearTimeout(timeoutId);
        if (pillDot) pillDot.className = 'status-dot';
        if (pillLabel) pillLabel.textContent = 'Baseline Snapshot';
      });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .section-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .telemetry-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.35rem;
  }

  .panel-top {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .panel-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .meta-note {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .telemetry-indicator {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 0.38rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
  }

  .status-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--text-muted);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .status-dot.is-online {
    background: var(--live-dot);
  }

  .corpus-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
  }

  .corpus-cell {
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.22rem;
  }

  .corpus-val {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .corpus-sub {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .telemetry-meta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .meta-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .archive-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  #telemetry :global(.archive-chip) {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.32rem 0.6rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .daemon-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
  }

  .daemon-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .daemon-state {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .spec-title code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.88em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .trace-box {
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
    background: var(--bg-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .corpus-strip {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .telemetry-meta-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 440px) {
    .corpus-strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
